{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-2ac2464ef4779a305953","clause_number":"八、","title":"八、內服液劑之使用原則：(94/11/1、97/3/1、97/12 /1)","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":2,"pdf_page_end":2,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000040","raw_text":"八、內服液劑之使用原則：(94/11/1、97/3/1、97/12 /1)","display_text":"八、內服液劑之使用原則：(94/11/1、97/3/1、97/12 /1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[40]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000041","raw_text":"（一）12歲(含)以下兒童得使用內服液劑(97/3/1)。","display_text":"（一）12歲(含)以下兒童得使用內服液劑(97/3/1)。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[41]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000042","raw_text":"（二）不適合服用固型製劑之病人，如施行管灌飲食等，得依病情需要使用內服液劑(97/12/1)。","display_text":"（二）不適合服用固型製劑之病人，如施行管灌飲食等，得依病情需要使用內服液劑(97/12/1)。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[42]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000043","raw_text":"（三）非為兒童或吞嚥困難患者所設計之內服液劑，得依病情需要使用(97/12/1)。","display_text":"（三）非為兒童或吞嚥困難患者所設計之內服液劑，得依病情需要使用(97/12/1)。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[43]"}],"ancestors":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000001","raw_text":"藥品給付規定通則","display_text":"藥品給付規定通則","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[1]"}],"nested_tables":{},"references":[],"missing_source_paragraphs":[],"original_nodes":[{"clause_id":"PAY-2ac2464ef4779a305953","clause_number":"八、","parent_clause_id":"PAY-09496134b5cd6fd0db77","original_text":"八、內服液劑之使用原則：(94/11/1、97/3/1、97/12 /1)","source_paragr